{"synopsis":"Dahulu kala, seorang pemuda bernama Krash dipandang rendah sebagai \"orang gagal\" dan dikhianati oleh orang-orang yang ia sebut sekutu. Namun di ambang kematian, ia memperoleh sebuah keajaiban: sebuah \"Regresi\" sekali pakai. Ia tidak akan pernah bisa menggunakan kekuatan itu lagi, tetapi dengan pengetahuannya tentang masa depan, ia memulai kehidupan keduanya. Untuk menyelamatkan dunia dari kehancuran—dan untuk membalas dendam kepada mereka yang pernah menginjak-injaknya—ia menjalankan rencananya. Mencuri keterampilan, menyempurnakannya, dan menumpuknya setinggi mungkin. Melampaui bahkan \"penipu\" terkuat sekalipun, \"Pencuri Keterampilan\" terhebat pun bangkit!","alternative_title":"먼치킨 스킬 도둑이 되었다","author":"Burgerman, Muhwaggocran","artist":"IZ","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"84d4d932-cb65-4d0c-8393-4b8b4de8dd3a","number":"40","chapter":"40","title":"Chapter 40","date":"2026-06-29","released":"2026-06-29","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"b63263b7-53fb-42d6-a82c-053c170e033d","number":"39","chapter":"39","title":"Chapter 39","date":"2026-06-21","released":"2026-06-21","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"88b7e52a-2ff4-4b0c-bd14-ab0ba0c77402","number":"38","chapter":"38","title":"Chapter 38","date":"2026-06-21","released":"2026-06-21","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"42520216-fe72-4bb2-bd7a-da6735934b35","number":"37","chapter":"37","title":"Chapter 37","date":"2026-06-15","released":"2026-06-15","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"6446c1e0-440c-43e3-907f-ae9ff21c30c5","number":"36","chapter":"36","title":"Chapter 36","date":"2026-05-31","released":"2026-05-31","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"f2d29880-a169-4363-bee6-73f13e430f94","number":"35","chapter":"35","title":"Chapter 35","date":"2026-05-25","released":"2026-05-25","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"870280a2-df6a-4c4b-ba3a-34e436f7729e","number":"34","chapter":"34","title":"Chapter 34","date":"2026-05-16","released":"2026-05-16","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"59340047-9738-47a9-864c-dc5bff2a953b","number":"33","chapter":"33","title":"Cha